# Ontology optional independent deploy — ADR-09 BOUNDARY B
# Status: wording + flags only. Co-deploy with control plane remains production default.
# NOT compose long-running. Control plane split NOT authorized.
# See reports/five-products/ADR09_ONTOLOGY_BOUNDARY.md
#
# Copy (only if running an optional ontology-focused process):
#   cp ontology_optional.env.example .env.ontology-optional
#
# Config authority (do not invent a second registry):
#   $AIPLAT_HOME/ontologies/{domain_id}.yaml + registry.json

# Optional: point home (default ~/.aiplat when unset)
# AIPLAT_HOME=/tmp/aiplat-ontology-optional

# BOUNDARY C one-shot health (phase_health.sh sets these; leave unset for co-deploy)
# AIPLAT_ONTOLOGY_OPTIONAL_SPLIT=1
# ADR09_ONTOLOGY_HEALTH_PORT=18767
# ADR09_ONTOLOGY_AIPLAT_HOME=/tmp/aiplat-ontology-optional
